    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you can’t put up Trainer Tips if you don’t have\nnifty nuggets to share!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd there’s still plenty in this world that I don’t\nknow!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
